job_title: Senior Python Backend Developer
company_repo: fastapi/fastapi
salary_range: $140k-$180k
overview: "We're seeking a Senior Python Backend Developer to join the FastAPI core team, helping evolve one of Python's most popular web frameworks used by companies like Microsoft, Netflix, and Uber. You'll work on high-performance async web APIs, contribute to the core framework, and help shape the future of modern Python web development."
overview_reason: "Based on README.md showing FastAPI's wide adoption by major tech companies and its focus on high performance, async Python web development."
